  "sections": [
    {
      "selector": "#top",
      "type": "hero",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 72,
      "width": 1920,
      "height": 899,
      "heading": "Intricate Mehndi Timeless Beauty",
      "backgroundColor": "#F8F1E5",
      "callsToAction": [
        "Explore My Work",
        "Book a Consultation"
      ],
      "text": "NOW BOOKING 2026 WEDDING SEASON Intricate Mehndi Timeless Beauty Luxury bridal and event mehndi artistry designed with intention, detail, and tradition. Explore My Work Book a Consultation",
      "layout": "centered",
      "assetUrls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": "#about",
      "type": "features",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 971,
      "width": 1920,
      "height": 952,
      "heading": "Artistry Rooted in Tradition",
      "backgroundColor": "#F8F1E5",
      "callsToAction": [
        "Meet the Artist"
      ],
      "text": "THE ARTIST Artistry Rooted in Tradition I learned mehndi the way most of us learn anything that matters — sitting close to someone who had been doing it for thirty years, asking what each part meant before asking how to draw it. Every design begins with a conversation. What you are carrying that day, who matters most in the room, what your mother or grandmother would recognise in it. The patterns are traditional because the tradition earns it, not because it is a trend. I work slowly and I only take a limited number of weddings each season, so nothing I draw is rushed. That is the whole promis",
      "layout": "centered",
      "assetUrls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": "#services",
      "type": "features",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1923,
      "width": 1920,
      "height": 1964,
      "heading": "Services",
      "backgroundColor": "#EFE3CF",
      "callsToAction": [
        "Learn More"
      ],
      "text": "WHAT I OFFER Services Every service begins with a conversation about your day. Prices shown are starting points — the quote you receive is based on the design you choose. PHOTO Photo: full bridal hand, intricate bridal pattern Bridal Mehndi Full-hand and foot bridal work, drawn around the story of your wedding and the people in it. from $450 Learn More PHOTO Photo: bridesmaid hands, delicate motif work Bridesmaid Mehndi Elegant, lighter designs that sit beautifully beside the bride without competing with her. from $85 Learn More PHOTO Photo: engagement hand, contemporary linework Engagement Me",
      "layout": "centered",
      "assetUrls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": "#gallery",
      "type": "features",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3887,
      "width": 1920,
      "height": 1266,
      "heading": "Gallery",
      "backgroundColor": "#F8F1E5",
      "callsToAction": [
        "View Full Gallery"
      ],
      "text": "SELECTED WORK Gallery A sample of recent bridal and event work. Follow along for new designs each week. Bridal mehndi covering the full palm and back of the hand in dense traditional motif work PHOTO: BRIDAL PALM, DENSE TRADITIONAL WORK Fine Arabic-style linework trailing down the fingers of an open hand PHOTO: ARABIC FINGER LINEWORK Intricate henna detail across the backs of several fingers PHOTO: FINGER DETAIL, MACRO A minimal modern mehndi design with fine single-line botanical elements PHOTO: MINIMAL MODERN DESIGN Henna applied to the feet, photographed against pale fabric PHOTO: FEET MEHN",
      "layout": "centered",
      "assetUrls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": "#packages",
      "type": "features",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 5153,
      "width": 1920,
      "height": 1765,
      "heading": "Packages",
      "backgroundColor": "#EFE3CF",
      "callsToAction": [
        "Request a Quote"
      ],
      "text": "COLLECTIONS Packages Every package can be adjusted to your day. What you see here is the shape of the work, not a fixed menu. MOST REQUESTED The Signature Bride The full bridal experience The most requested package. A complete bridal design built around your wedding, drawn over a consultation. Full bridal mehndi, both hands and feet Bridal design consultation and reference review Custom motifs from your wedding details Long-wear natural henna, mixed for depth Two dedicated sittings Bridal-party discount for five or more Aftercare kit and longevity planning from $450 Request a Quote The Guest E",
      "layout": "centered",
      "assetUrls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": "#process",
      "type": "features",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 6918,
      "width": 1920,
      "height": 615,
      "heading": "The Process",
      "backgroundColor": "#F8F1E5",
      "callsToAction": [],
      "text": "HOW IT WORKS The Process 01 Inquiry Tell me your date, your location, and what you have in mind. I reply within two days with availability. 02 Consultation We look at references together, talk through what you want to wear and carry, and settle on a direction. 03 Design Planning Your motifs are chosen and drawn out in advance, so the sitting is about the work rather than the decisions. 04 Your Mehndi Experience The day itself, unhurried, with everything prepared before you arrive.",
      "layout": "centered",
      "assetUrls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": "#testimonials",
      "type": "features",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 7533,
      "width": 1920,
      "height": 964,
      "heading": "Testimonials",
      "backgroundColor": "#EFE3CF",
      "callsToAction": [],
      "text": "KIND WORDS Testimonials “ Every detail was more beautiful than I imagined. My bridal mehndi felt completely personal and meaningful. Ayesha R. Bridal, destination wedding “ The designs were intricate, elegant, and lasted beautifully throughout the wedding celebrations. Priya S. Engagement and mehndi night “ I brought a photo I had saved for two years. Hamna turned it into something far better than I had pictured. Sana M. Bridal “ Calm, unhurried, and genuinely warm. Our guests still talk about the night. Nadia & Omar Mehndi night, party of twelve",
      "layout": "centered",
      "assetUrls": []
    },
